From: "MOTOR-46 (Claude)" <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 19:23:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] sync: FlyWeb 3.2 sync account warning bars
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

FlyWeb/docs/sync-cuenta.md §6.2, §6.3 and §11.

FlyWebSyncAccountInfoBarDelegate, on the pattern of the «account
deleted» bar:
- «¿Has sido tú?» with the newest account event, how many more there
  are, «He sido yo» and «No he sido yo» (invalidates every token at once
  and opens the page);
- «The sync key was changed from another Mac», instead of Brave's
  «account deleted» bar, which waits while the account service asks the
  server why the chain was disabled.

BraveSyncAlertsService observes the account service to show them.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
